[[0,576503,0,15,1,14,"2015-10-10T00:45:25","YallJusRaycis","",[],"","My 2015 SHHHHHEEEEEEEEIIIITT comics","http://imgur.com/a/EPubT","TyroneComics"],[1,2796295,0,1,0,1,"2015-10-12T00:27:51","tripledge","",[],"<p>It's good to have you back! You were one of the best comic artists we had on the old sub. </p>\n<p>Thank you for the gallery. Each one is a regular &quot;massa&quot;-piece. Of course, you're also more than welcome to post them individually if you like. </p>"],[2,2796811,2796295,1,0,1,"2015-10-12T01:24:54","YallJusRaycis","",[],"<p>Thank you! This sub seems a little dead. I wonder if it could use a plug in <a href=\"/v/niggers\">v/niggers</a> and other non PC places.</p>"],[3,2796959,2796811,0,0,0,"2015-10-12T01:37:16","tripledge","",[],"<p>We already have one in <a href=\"/v/niggers\">/v/niggers</a>. I'm still looking for other active like-minded subs who would be interested in linking us.</p>"],[1,3192781,0,0,0,0,"2015-11-14T01:55:14","uberdoober","",[],"<p>These are fantastic! Please gibs us mo'</p>"]]
[[0,576504,0,8,0,8,"2015-10-10T00:46:12","xeemee","",[],"","Yes, the CIA Director Was Part of the JFK Assassination Cover-Up | POLITICO","http://www.politico.com/magazine/story/2015/10/jfk-assassination-john-mccone-warren-commission-cia-213197?curator=MediaREDEF","altnews"],[1,2774710,0,1,0,1,"2015-10-10T00:57:37","xeemee","",[],"<p>in addition to the CIA, Michael Collines Piper has made an excellent case for Israeli involvement as well in his book, <strong><a href=\"http://americanfreepress.net/PDF/Final_Judgment.pdf\">Final Judgment: The Missing Link in the JFK Assassination</a></strong></p>\n<p>in brief, Michael elaborates on 2 primary reasons for Israeli/Mossad involvement, 1) JFK was insisting that the U.S. Israel lobby, AIPAC, register as a foreign agent, which of course Israel refused to do since this would compromise their ability to influence politics in the U.S. through donations and, 2), JFK was instant that Israel's Dimona facility be opened to nuclear inspectors, which, again, Israel was unwilling to do since the facility was (and may be currently) used to enrich uranium for nuclear weapons - something JFK saw as a tremendously destabilizing threat in the middle east</p>\n<p>to this day Israel will not publicly admit it possesses nuclear weapons and, as such, it is immune to inspections and nuclear weapons treaties </p>"],[2,2779167,2774710,0,0,0,"2015-10-10T08:36:21","clickbot","",[],"<p>We knew the CIA covered it up and made someone who was arrested in the context of a police shooting, in which he might not even have been involved in, the scapegoat, so they were definitely involved and probably also hired the assassin. But we still don't know why. Conspiracy theories abound.</p>\n<p>The documents are still classified despite their age, because releasing them &quot;could confuse the public&quot;, so whatever the motive was, it is still relevant today.</p>\n<p>ad 1: JFK could not force that, it is hardly reason for the Mossad or the Kosher Nostra to cause such a scene. Besides, Mossad has never been competent in covering up their assassinations, or maybe they just never felt the need to.</p>\n<p>ad 2: There must not be a missile gap! JFK knew that secretly the USSR did not have nearly the nuclear arsenal the USA did, despite their production capabilities. Was he looking for someone else to engage in an arms race with?</p>"],[3,2782600,2779167,0,0,0,"2015-10-10T19:26:49","xeemee","",[],"<p>thanks for your comment</p>\n<p>regarding your #1 and #2 points, i would highly recommend reading Pipers book, <a href=\"http://americanfreepress.net/PDF/Final_Judgment.pdf\">Final Judgment</a> - <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2utTWSdq8YY\">here's a video lecture</a> he did</p>\n<p>regarding a nuclear armed Israel, you are ignoring documented history - JFK indeed saw a nuclear Israel as a direct threat to peace in the region and U.S. interests</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The sharpest example took place almost 50 years ago, when John F. Kennedy demanded that David Ben-Gurion end Israel’s nuclear deterrent program, deemed necessary to ensure Jewish survival in a very hostile world.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>in addition to the extensive sources in Piper's book, the above comes from an article, <em>When Ben-Gurion said no to JFK</em> , in the <a href=\"http://www.jpost.com/Opinion/Op-Ed-Contributors/When-Ben-Gurion-said-no-to-JFK\">Jerusalem Post</a>, 2010</p>\n<p>regarding both AIPAC and nuclear Israel, Ben-Gurion stated that he saw Kennedy as <em>a threat to the very existence of Israel</em></p>\n<p>i am guessing you may not be aware of the critical role the Jewish lobby groups play in U.S. politics - here's a good video that addresses this...</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Ed7WqaXyz0\">The Israel Lobby: AIPAC Influence on US Foreign policy?</a></p>"]]
